editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/STATE_LEDGER.md:86:**Deployment since the Line at entry: none.** It stays *none* until the ford's single Wind burst (day 53). It stays *one* through day 90, apart from the two unwitnessed tests on day 96, which are not logged as deployment.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/STATE_LEDGER.md:99:| Seln | Shadow; Bronze; fifteen years' service; left without notice or form; four keys surrendered | Uninjured | First honest employment; not to be asked for his report | Mechanism known since edition B6 ch37; recognized that Cael kept his file; “twice more” count remains two; knows the case's contents [B6-reconciled 2026-10-11: audit B5, C2, D2] |
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/STATE_LEDGER.md:104:**Who knows the cache/falsification history:** the five travelers plus Vastin. Vastin does not know the integration mechanism. Ephram, Withrow, Bracken, Ilsev, Havel, Rooke, Gault, Jent and the public know neither. [B6-reconciled 2026-10-11: audit N6]
