editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/BOOK_MAP.md-112-| **NEW — The ferry's first landing** (277th, high water) | quiet landing | 1,500 | Rope and flood. Vastin is seen holding a physical line, with no Path, before anyone knows it is him. Iron Wall must not show before the cut. |
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/BOOK_MAP.md-113-| **NEW — The tail in Treswick** (291st–292nd) | absent | 2,500 | After the alley, Seln and Cael tail a hood through the outer district at night. The hood passes through a tier gate Cael cannot legally cross. The faction stays faceless and unlocated, and the promise and the bar become physical. |
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/BOOK_MAP.md:114:| **NEW — Water at the seep** (301st–302nd, dry camps) | "two camps with no water" | 3,000 | The two crews must water themselves and a mule at a seep where shale-backs stand on a slope. Teague's field captaincy is shown. The young one moves too fast and the tall woman stops him with a hand. That is his habit, set up for the pass. |
