books/book-08-before-the-paths/chapters/chapter-03.md:21:The records first.
books/book-08-before-the-paths/chapters/chapter-03.md-22-
books/book-08-before-the-paths/chapters/chapter-03.md-23-He catalogued them as they came out because a catalogue was what he had, and because the man taking them out was doing the same thing with his hands, and had been doing it for forty years, and it was the first time Cael had ever watched the Compact's method used against the Compact.
