   148	### Observable mechanics — PROVISIONAL, on the page from Book 7 (Void Roads), 2026-09-04
   149	
   150	What the edge territories call *quiet ground* and what Karis names *the Quieting* (B7 Ch15). Everything below is shown, measured or paced in Book 7's prose; nothing about SOURCE is disclosed or theorized there.
