+16. **Unnamed roles — KEEP.** No new named person, place, or animal is minted; all listed newcomers remain roles (`manuscript/chapter-01.md:3-45,197-251`; `manuscript/chapter-02.md:15-47`; `manuscript/chapter-04.md:81-85`; `manuscript/chapter-06.md:61-77`).
