+
+### Inventory and placement
+
+- **Cold-stay unit:** Pike's rate is present once (`manuscript/chapter-01.md:217`). The missing full source exchange is the keeper's “Pike” and Pike's “Eleventh” (`books/book-08-before-the-paths/chapters/chapter-01.md:13`); fix 1 restores it in place. Pike says *Eleventh* to the lower-inn keeper, in answer to the keeper's warning/prompt.
