    57	
    58	Six at a table on the 270th, with the ice going next week and a map that runs east. Karis's answer lies west, inside walls, under a registry. Since his Kindling, Cael has stayed out of registries. [B7-reconciled 2026-10-11: OWNER-pending #48] The kit reads everyone but him. He has written *west, and inside* and does not like the sentence.
