+## 6. New canon minted
+
+Rulings follow the report's list (`AUTHOR-REPORT.md:128-145`):
+
+1. **Lowmarch in the cold — KEEP.** The shed, horse-walk, rope-house, ice stages, green, and scow preparations extend the established ferry without contradicting its locked closure (`manuscript/chapter-01.md:9-45,137-181`; `manuscript/chapter-04.md:69-103`; `manuscript/chapter-05.md:233-243`; `manuscript/chapter-06.md:279-283`).
