+**PASS — no owner-supplied name is needed.** All named people and places in chapters 1–6 already exist in the plan or inherited canon: Cael, Lira, Brom, Karis, Seln, Oryn, Teague, Pike, Hesk, Vell, Ephram, Reydan, Daeva, Lowmarch, Thornwater, Ostrand, Ternhall, Denvash, Ardenmere, the Fallow, Stair, and Hall (`BOOK_MAP.md:19-29,480-484`; `manuscript/chapter-01.md:15-19,49-65`; `manuscript/chapter-03.md:295-301`; `manuscript/chapter-05.md:87-93`; `manuscript/chapter-06.md:245-253`). The factor, ferryman, ferryman's boy, ice carter, keeper, older healer, tall one, broad man/bow, young one, bowman, steading's woman, and three grey men remain unnamed roles (`manuscript/chapter-01.md:3-45,197-251`; `manuscript/chapter-02.md:15-47`; `manuscript/chapter-04.md:81-85,169`; `manuscript/chapter-06.md:61-77`). No animal receives a name.
